# One line. Run from the repo root by `orgasmic verify TASK-6HJYT`.
#
# Both control-path fences, against a stubbed daemon that answers the liveness
# question and refuses the recovery inventory — the board whose durable session
# history cannot be read at all. The stub records every path it is asked for, so
# the tests catch *which question the fence asks*, not merely the answer it
# reaches: on a healthy board the two sources agree and are indistinguishable by
# return value.
env -u ORGASMIC_RUN_ID -u ORGASMIC_HOME cargo test -p orgasmic-cli --bin orgasmic fence
